{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "cca4dccc1ead99e49fd835ad0ceeb3f5e57c8fdb7e76cb14ed84884b6abbbf1e", "ja": "うーん……どうしよう。\nさすがに全部をひとりで食べるのは……。", "zh": "嗯……怎么办才好。\n要一个人把这么多全部吃完，实在是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0d119bc9ef5f6395039571daae8ea7dde9c0217e1970714b5ebeffc334411973", "ja": "お疲れ様、真。\n……って、すごい量のお菓子だな！　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，真。……等等，这一大堆零食是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e679d567c2d9fae833d18a6aef94cf5630fd7b0c7f554f5c7f9b95b0c41e73f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\n今日限定販売の、お菓子のハロウィンボックスです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦了！  \n这是今天限定发售的零食万圣节礼盒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "5a4b0b0be7a87e586084efa1da8e229c4a473cdae1e918c5c337955c4c831b38", "ja": "ここに来る途中のコンビニで、カボチャの\nボックスがカワイくてつい買っちゃったんですっ！", "zh": "来这里的路上，我在便利店看到南瓜盒子太可爱了，一不小心就买下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "da0302b19d1dfead6df461b9ae051aa898c5eefb29eb4263ad7aad6a170e280d", "ja": "ただ、開けてみたら、入ってる量が意外に多くて。\nみんなと分けられればいいかもなんですけど……。", "zh": "只是打开一看，没想到里面的分量还挺多的。\n要是能和大家分着吃，或许就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0ed834542a6a9256f70e922e5dc58f7812eb0505600b43f5ac696a187a798858", "ja": "確かに……今日はたまたま予定やオフが\n重なってたりで、人もいないんだよな。", "zh": "说得也是……今天恰好大家的日程和休息日都撞上了，人都不在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d89dcb8312a278656e98c3a4fd09eb1daa9929dd4d2c28e8c7bf54e809fb90a5", "ja": "でも、別にひとりで食べられなくもないんじゃないか？\n体を動かした後とか、甘いものも欲しいだろうし。", "zh": "不过，也不是不能一个人吃吧？运动完之后，应该也会想吃点甜的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "0db365de5e409b084b10a85c55a074fec3592067a0552a22f7f1f117822bb069", "ja": "う……そうなんですけど。この前、それでうっかり\n肌荒れしちゃって。塗り薬で治したところなんですよ。", "zh": "呜……确实是这样。不过前阵子因为那样一不小心皮肤过敏了。才刚用药膏治好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c9cadf6dce29666bb0cd94c4fe33c2a0b4300ffa5e1ecaa201b04205e7edc57f", "ja": "あ、そうなのか。それは避けたいところだな……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样啊。那确实得避免这种情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "da7a875bc50c6feac1db3a901660ca21ecfbfbcc36d47e7286d459c9f1479ad4", "ja": "はい……。だからちょうど、お菓子の食べ過ぎは\n頑張って自制してたところで……そうだ！", "zh": "是的……所以我刚好一直在努力克制自己，不要吃太多点心……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "e7e75571ff581479ed7e4381b59514c0e3b74e11ca99b1ab9a1e4fc9c626e965", "ja": "分けっこしましょうよ！　{$P$}も、\n疲れたときこそ甘いものが欲しくなりません？", "zh": "我们分着吃吧！{$P$}先生，累的时候不是更想吃甜食吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "7278a1a6be674b89b74f0718e21f0ca7a168f2faf5f176b65b900635a0becb76", "ja": "はいっ。よかったらこれ、持って帰ってください！\nあ、でも！　食べ過ぎには気をつけてくださいね？", "zh": "好的！如果不嫌弃的话，请把这个带回去吧！\n啊，不过！可要注意别吃太多了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1012_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1038b6d966476632b348a66d140048fc937ba03b449a719d548f40aee6d9828a", "ja": "真に注意されてたのに、ついお菓子をあんなに。\nおかげで顔に……これって吹き出物か……？", "zh": "明明被真提醒过了，却还是一不小心吃了那么多零食。\n结果脸上……这难道是粉刺吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "672fa8003aee165978692c7f1c4ffac3f56485648f6ec75a8d666cffc17cf486", "ja": "おはようございまーす！　……って、あれ？\n{$P$}の顔のそれ……もしかして！", "zh": "早上好——！……咦，那个是……？\n{$P$}先生脸上的那个……难道是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1015_p", "source_sha256": "af96114276da0367fa8fc57a8a8635d750040d1b0d3cd5a8f8f8a20e25daed21", "ja": "ああ。忙しくて、つい糖分が欲しくなってな……。", "zh": "啊。因为太忙了，不知不觉就想吃点糖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "60c1e37a4b115b82b10a66c59cb12513ed7f113a8cbdc5e0eeeac1b11e819d69", "ja": "もう、だからボク言ったじゃないですか、\n気をつけてって！　でも……へへっ。", "zh": "真是的，我不是都说过了吗，\n要小心点！不过……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "1673782a506bc0b703f26e8fe9a2da5c6e50d63fcd635d26ec91458ab55fc76b", "ja": "{$P$}のそういうところ……結構、\n結構……お茶目ですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}的这种地方……其实、\n其实……还蛮调皮的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1018_p", "source_sha256": "85a961d91fea9ef39be42a8fdbc54fc726bea9513bc0265a569d2edba8aa3ac7", "ja": "あはは……お茶目というか、情けないというか。\n以後、気をつけるよ。", "zh": "哈哈……与其说是淘气，不如说是有点丢人。\n以后我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0423_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "a45a95ced388801956f32b8154e233b0e764383de8026c9a9c3169e3be57173d", "ja": "大丈夫ですって。よく効く塗り薬、持ってますから。\nあとで貸してあげますね！", "zh": "没事的啦。我带了很管用的外用药，\n等会儿借给你用哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
